    "faq_a1": "A spraying drone is an agricultural drone that applies crop protection products over a field automatically, following a GPS/RTK route. The XAG P150 MAX also spreads granules and carries cargo.",
    "faq_q2": "How does drone spraying differ from conventional spraying?",
    "faq_a2": "The drone never drives into the field: no soil compaction or crop damage, it works on wet ground and slopes, applies a precise rate, and the operator stays away from the chemicals. Choose the product and rate with your agronomist.",
    "faq_q3": "How much does the XAG P150 MAX cost in Georgia?",
    "faq_a3": "XAG P150 MAX packages: Starter ₾75,999, Pro ₾85,999, Business ₾104,999. See every price and what each package includes in the shop.",
    "faq_q4": "Where can I buy XAG drone parts?",
    "faq_a4": "From Premium Drones Georgia, the official XAG dealer. Original parts, batteries, chargers and generators are in stock in Georgia, with prices in the shop.",
