    "faq_q5": "Does Premium Drones Georgia offer service in Georgia?",
    "faq_a5": "Yes. We do diagnostics, repairs and maintenance with original parts. Service is in Tbilisi (by appointment), with field support from Lagodekhi.",
    "faq_q6": "Can the P150 MAX be used for cargo transport?",
    "faq_a6": "Yes. The P150 MAX carries up to 80 kg of cargo, for example to deliver materials and equipment to hard-to-reach places. Contact us for details.",
    "faq_q7": "Can the P150 MAX spread granules?",
    "faq_a7": "Yes. With its 115 L granule container, the P150 MAX spreads granular fertiliser, seed and other granules. See the specifications on the P150 MAX page.",
