    "pm_build_p": "IPX6K: wash the drone down with water. 63-inch propellers, folding arms and a modular build for transport. In the XAG One app: routes from the field shape, up to 10 fields per mission, two drones at once, and automatic return when liquid or power runs low. SRC 5 remote: 7-inch high-brightness screen, 8 hours of use. For centimetre accuracy, the XRTK 7 mobile station.",
